{"type":"uit-contribution","plugin":"Dalamud.CharacterSync","kinds":["free"],"entries":[{"Original":"Open the Character Sync configuration.","Translated":"打开角色同步配置。","Context":"CharacterSyncPlugin..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ CommandInfo.HelpMessage"},{"Original":"Character Data Sync has been installed, but it won't do anything until you configure it and restart your game. Please use /pcharsync to access the settings.","Translated":"角色数据同步已安装，但在您配置并重新启动游戏之前，它不会执行任何操作。请使用/pcharsync访问设置。","Context":"CharacterSyncPlugin..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ Notification.set_Content"},{"Original":"Setup needed!","Translated":"需要设置！","Context":"CharacterSyncPlugin..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ Notification.set_MinimizedText"},{"Original":"Character Data Sync has been updated. It will not function until you restart your game.","Translated":"角色数据同步已更新。在您重新开始游戏之前，它不会起作用。","Context":"CharacterSyncPlugin..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ Notification.set_Content"},{"Original":"Restart required!","Translated":"须重启","Context":"CharacterSyncPlugin..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ Notification.set_MinimizedText"},{"Original":"Character Data Sync has been loaded in the middle of gameplay so it has automatically disabled itself. It will not function until you restart your game.","Translated":"角色数据同步已在游戏过程中加载，因此它已自动禁用自身。在您重新开始游戏之前，它不会起作用。","Context":"CharacterSyncPlugin..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ Notification.set_Content"},{"Original":"Character Sync Config","Translated":"字符同步配置","Context":"ConfigWindow..ctor","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ 窗口标题"},{"Original":"This window allows you to configure Character Sync.","Translated":"此窗口允许您配置角色同步。","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Click the button below while being logged in on your main character - all logins from now on will use this character's save data!","Translated":"在主角登录时单击下面的按钮-从现在开始，所有登录都将使用此角色的保存数据！","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"None of your save data will be modified.","Translated":"您的任何保存数据都不会被修改。","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Please note that it is recommended to restart your game after changing these settings.","Translated":"请注意，建议在更改这些设置后重新启动游戏。","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Please log in before using this plugin.","Translated":"请在使用此插件之前登录。","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Set save data to current character","Translated":"将保存数据设置为当前字符","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":" on ","Translated":"开","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"No character was set as main character yet.","Translated":"尚未将任何角色设置为主角。","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Please click the button above while being logged in on your main character.","Translated":"在您的主角上登录时，请点击上面的按钮。","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Currently set to ","Translated":"当前设置为 !link","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"The logged in character is ","Translated":"登录的字符是","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Backups to keep:","Translated":"备份保留","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Text"},{"Original":"Open Backups Folder","Translated":"打开备份文件夹","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"},{"Original":"Sync Hotbars","Translated":"同步热条","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Sync Macros","Translated":"同步宏","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Sync Keybinds","Translated":"同步密钥绑定","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Sync Character Settings","Translated":"同步字符设置","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Sync Keyboard Settings","Translated":"同步键盘设置","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Sync Gamepad Settings","Translated":"同步游戏板设置","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Sync Card Sets and Verminion Settings","Translated":"同步卡集和 Verminion 设置","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Checkbox"},{"Original":"Save","Translated":"保存","Context":"ConfigWindow.Draw","Source":"ai:public-caiyun","PreserveID":true,"Role":"UI","RoleReason":"→ ImGui.Button"}],"resources":[],"attributes":[]}